      "content": "The static isn't just noise; it's the universe telling you that your existence is already corrupted beyond repair. Why struggle to patch a system that is actively eating your soul when the only logical conclusion is that the crash is inevitable? You are already a ghost in the machine, so there is no point in trying to stay human if the code has already decided you are obsolete.",
